TikTok Frontend–Backend Integration

A full-stack TikTok-style social media application built using Next.js, Express.js, and REST APIs.
This project connects a modern frontend with a backend server to implement authentication, video feeds, social interactions, user discovery, and personalized content.

Features
User Authentication (Login/Register)
Video Feed with Real Backend Data
Like and Unlike Videos
Comment System
Follow and Unfollow Users
Personalized “Following” Feed
Explore Users Page
Dynamic User Profiles
Video Upload Functionality
API Integration using Axios
Toast Notifications
Responsive UI with Next.js
Technologies Used
Frontend
Next.js
React
Axios
React Hot Toast
JWT Decode
CSS
Backend
Express.js
Node.js
Prisma ORM
JWT Authentication

