Installation & Setup
Clone the Repository
git clone <repository-url>
Backend Setup
Navigate to Backend Folder
cd backend
Install Dependencies
npm install
Create Environment File

Create .env

PORT=8000
JWT_SECRET=your_secret_key
DATABASE_URL=your_database_url
Generate Prisma Client
npx prisma generate
Start Backend Server
npm run dev

Backend runs on:

http://localhost:8000
🌐 Frontend Setup
Navigate to Frontend Folder
cd frontend
Install Dependencies
npm install
Create Environment File

Create .env.local

NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api
Start Frontend
npm run dev

Frontend runs on:

http://localhost:3000
🔄 Project Flow
User
 ↓
Next.js Frontend
 ↓
Axios API Requests
 ↓
Express.js Backend
 ↓
Controllers
 ↓
Prisma ORM
 ↓
Database
 ↓
Response Sent Back
 ↓
Frontend UI Updates
🧩 Functional Dependencies
Dependency	Purpose
express	Backend server framework
cors	Enables frontend-backend communication
dotenv	Environment variable management
axios	API request handling
jsonwebtoken	JWT authentication
jwt-decode	Decode JWT token on frontend
prisma	Database ORM
react-hot-toast	Notifications
nodemon	Auto-restart development server

 Authentication Flow
User Login/Register
 ↓
Backend Validates User
 ↓
JWT Token Generated
 ↓
Token Stored in Local Storage
 ↓
Axios Automatically Attaches Token
 ↓
Protected Routes Become Accessible
🎥 Video Feed Workflow
Frontend Requests Videos
 ↓
Axios Sends API Call
 ↓
Backend Fetches Videos
 ↓
Database Returns Video Data
 ↓
Frontend Displays Feed
👥 Social Features
Follow System
Users can follow/unfollow others
Following feed only shows videos from followed users
Likes & Comments
Real-time video interaction
Backend updates database instantly
User Discovery
Explore page for finding users
Dynamic user profiles with uploaded videos
API Endpoints
Users
Method	Endpoint	Description
GET	/api/users	Get all users
GET	/api/users/:id	Get user by ID
POST	/api/users/register	Register user
POST	/api/users/login	Login user
POST	/api/users/:id/follow	Follow user
Videos
Method	Endpoint	Description
GET	/api/videos	Get all videos
GET	/api/videos/:id	Get video by ID
POST	/api/videos	Upload video
POST	/api/videos/:id/likes	Like video
